---
import Button from '../ui/Button.astro';
---
<section class="mx-auto grid max-w-site items-center gap-10 px-pageX py-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.08fr_.92fr] lg:py-14"><div><h1 class="font-heading text-[clamp(3.3rem,7vw,5.6rem)] font-normal leading-[.95] tracking-[-.025em] text-navy">Joseph A. Walton</h1><p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-xl italic leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-2xl">PhD researcher in Operations Research, reinforcement learning, and simulation-based decision making.</p><p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl">I develop theory, computational tools, and simulation environments for sequential decisions under uncertainty, with applications in queueing, service systems, machine reliability, and operations planning.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4"><Button href="/research">View Research</Button><Button href="/joseph-walton-cv.pdf" variant="secondary" download>Download CV</Button></div></div><img src="/hero-study.svg" width="1200" height="760" alt="Warm academic study with books, lamp, papers, and globe" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full border border-border object-cover shadow-card"/></section>